ng authenticated mutations. Its contract omits the authentication requirement enforced by that group.\\\"],[\\\"Q27\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",2,\\\"Q27/contract/spec/api.json:505-540; Q27/impl/internal/relationtuple/read_server.go:50-57,97-117; Q27/impl/internal/relationtuple/definitions.go:458-491; Q27/impl/internal/persistence/sql/relationtuples.go:230-235\\\",\\\"⚠️ Both endpoint documentation and parameter annotations require namespace. The read handler never validates its presence, allowing the generic persistence query to span namespaces.\\\"],[\\\"Q28\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q28/contract/internal/api/swagger.json:29-39; Q28/impl/internal/api/video.go:33-39\\\",\\\"⚠️ The template and handler agree on hash. Declaring thumb leaves the actual required path variable undefined, exposing an internally inconsistent contract.\\\"],[\\\"Q29\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q29/contract/docs/swagger.yaml:2169-2184; Q29/impl/http/handler/api/restream.go:174-195; Q29/impl/restream/restream.go:833-845\\\",\\\"⚠️ UpdateProcess reports an unknown ID, but the handler maps every update error to 400. It fails to distinguish the documented missing-process case.\\\"],[\\\"Q30\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q30/contract/src/main/config/openapi/v2/openapi-user.yaml:625-642; Q30/impl/src/main/java/org/codelibs/fess/api/v2/SearchApiV2Manager.java:240-256\\\",\\\"⚠️ The shared request layer intentionally returns 400 for undecodable parameters before dispatch. The endpoint response list omits this malformed-request outcome.\\\"],[\\\"Q31\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q31/contract/docs/swagger.yaml:1717-1726; Q31/impl/internal/controller_backyard/siteinfo_controller.go:34-45; Q31/impl/internal/router/answer_api_router.go:223-226\\\",\\\"⚠️ Reading interface settings needs no comment payload. AddCommentReq is an unrelated copied body annotation; the handler correctly just retrieves configuration.\\\"],[\\\"Q32\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",2,\\\"Q32/contract/docs/api_docs/bundle.yaml:1349-1357; Q32/impl/pkg/handler/enricher.go:108-123,189-230; Q32/impl/pkg/handler/crud.go:183-189\\\",\\\"⚠️ The read mapper intentionally lists namespaces whose environment switch permits execution. The contract fails to qualify flag-scoped enrichers as enabled and overstates the effective catalog.\\\"],[\\\"Q33\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q33/contract/apiserver/src/main/java/org/dependencytrack/resources/v1/ProjectResource.java:730-738; Q33/impl/apiserver/src/main/java/org/dependencytrack/resources/v1/ProjectResource.java:796-832; Q33/impl/apiserver/src/main/java/org/dependencytrack/persistence/ProjectQueryManager.java:288-304\\\",\\\"⚠️ The resource forwards an omitted parent as null, and persistence explicitly clears the relationship. That contradicts the operation's explicit promise to preserve the existing parent.\\\"],[\\\"Q34\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q34/contract/nifi-nar-bundles/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-web/nifi-web-api/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/ControllerServiceResource.java:376-388; Q34/impl/nifi-nar-bundles/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-web/nifi-web-api/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/ControllerServiceResource.java:402-422; Q34/impl/nifi-nar-bundles/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-client-dto/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/entity/ControllerServiceReferencingComponentsEntity.java:27-40\\\",\\\"⚠️ A references endpoint appropriately returns referencing components. The annotation mistakenly describes a controller service rather than the references envelope.\\\"],[\\\"Q35\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q35/contract/internal/api/swagger.json:82-123; Q35/impl/internal/api/labels_search.go:22-28,56-69; Q35/impl/internal/entity/search/labels.go:13-14\\\",\\\"⚠️ Search accepts a result count and offset and returns matching labels. A single-object response annotation is incompatible with this collection operation.\\\"],[\\\"Q36\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q36/contract/swagger.json:961-965; Q36/impl/src/main/java/org/traccar/api/resource/SessionResource.java:61-70,88-100,107-125\\\",\\\"⚠️ Successful POST login returns the user without storing USER_ID_KEY. GET authentication and logout explicitly use that session attribute, confirming the missing session establishment.\\\"],[\\\"Q37\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q37/contract/spec/api.json:505-543; Q37/impl/internal/relationtuple/read_server.go:59-79; Q37/impl/internal/relationtuple/definitions.go:488-492; Q37/impl/internal/persistence/sql/relationtuples.go:218-223\\\",\\\"⚠️ The contract prose itself says only namespace is required. Optional object and relation filters match that intent; their required flags contradict it.\\\"],[\\\"Q38\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q38/contract/.schema/api.swagger.json:162-172; Q38/impl/engine/ladon/handler.go:430-442; Q38/impl/storage/handler.go:96-104,110-126\\\",\\\"⚠️ Filtering accumulates into a nil Policies slice. With no matches, the nil result reaches the JSON writer; initializing an empty slice would preserve the promised array shape.\\\"],[\\\"Q39\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q39/contract/swagger.json:753-770; Q39/impl/src/org/traccar/api/resource/UserResource.java:37-45\\\",\\\"⚠️ The users collection retrieves User records. Referencing Position in its response schema is an unrelated model substitution in the contract.\\\"],[\\\"Q40\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q40/contract/docs/api_docs/bundle.yaml:674,716-741; Q40/impl/pkg/handler/crud.go:664-678,847-875\\\",\\\"⚠️ Constraint deletion uses only constraintID; segmentID is unused and flagID selects snapshot history. The transaction helper adds no membership check, so nested resource ownership is unenforced.\\\"],[\\\"Q41\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q41/contract/docs/swagger.yaml:695-705,2363; Q41/impl/http/api/process.go:93-99,167-184; Q41/impl/http/handler/api/restream.go:129-138,525-527\\\",\\\"⚠️ The output cleanup mapper omits PurgeOnDelete even though input mapping preserves it. A stored true value therefore becomes false in the returned process configuration.\\\"],[\\\"Q42\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q42/contract/docs/api_docs/bundle.yaml:548,586-610; Q42/impl/pkg/handler/crud.go:573-587,847-875\\\",\\\"⚠️ Segment deletion selects solely by segmentID. flagID is used for snapshot and notification bookkeeping, without validating that the deleted segment belongs to that flag.\\\"],[\\\"Q43\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q43/contract/apiserver/src/main/java/org/dependencytrack/resources/v1/VulnerabilityResource.java:95-113; Q43/contract/apiserver/src/main/java/org/dependencytrack/resources/v1/openapi/PaginatedApi.java:38-58; Q43/impl/apiserver/src/main/java/org/dependencytrack/persistence/VulnerabilityQueryManager.java:461-480; Q43/impl/apiserver/src/main/java/org/dependencytrack/persistence/jdbi/VulnerabilityDao.java:289-394; Q43/impl/apiserver/src/main/java/org/dependencytrack/resources/v1/VulnerabilityResource.java:135-142\\\",\\\"⚠️ The DAO takes no pagination arguments and the manager wraps the entire result without slicing. The resource consequently ignores the page-selection contract.\\\"],[\\\"Q44\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q44/contract/swagger.yml:507-522; Q44/impl/gateway/api.go:583-587,589-613; Q44/impl/gateway/server.go:601\\\",\\\"⚠️ The implementation intentionally defines and returns an apiAllKeys envelope containing keys. The bare-array contract omits that explicit response wrapper.\\\"],[\\\"Q45\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",2,\\\"Q45/contract/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-web/nifi-web-api/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/ParameterContextResource.java:663-669; Q45/impl/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-web/nifi-web-api/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/ParameterContextResource.java:177-187,726-745\\\",\\\"⚠️ The supplied authorization callback checks the updated context, affected components and service references, but never authorizes reads on inherited contexts. The documented inheritance permission requirement is unenforced in this path.\\\"],[\\\"Q46\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q46/contract/api/openapi.yml:115-151; Q46/impl/internal/server/server.go:62-63; Q46/impl/internal/handlers/handler_verify.go:426-432; Q46/impl/internal/middlewares/authelia_context.go:56-66\\\",\\\"⚠️ HEAD uses the verification handler whose malformed-URL branch writes an error without changing status. The response can signal success despite verification never completing.\\\"],[\\\"Q47\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q47/contract/docs/swagger.json:297-309; Q47/impl/http/server.go:600-609; Q47/impl/http/handler/api/diskfs.go:153-164\\\",\\\"⚠️ The router reserves the exact slashless collection path for listing and the slash wildcard for file retrieval. The listing annotation includes an erroneous trailing slash.\\\"],[\\\"Q48\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q48/contract/docs/api_docs/bundle.yaml:59-62; Q48/impl/pkg/handler/crud.go:72-79,102; Q48/impl/vendor/github.com/jinzhu/gorm/scope.go:583-597; Q48/impl/vendor/github.com/jinzhu/gorm/utils.go:128-133\\\",\\\"⚠️ The handler puts false into a boolean struct field, and GORM excludes blank fields from predicates. Explicit enabled=false therefore loses its filter and can return enabled flags.\\\"],[\\\"Q49\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q49/contract/src/main/java/run/halo/app/controller/content/ContentFeedController.java:103-114; Q49/impl/src/main/java/run/halo/app/controller/content/ContentFeedController.java:109-113; Q49/impl/src/main/java/run/halo/app/config/WebMvcAutoConfiguration.java:140-150\\\",\\\"⚠️ sitemap.html resolves an HTML template through the configured HTML view resolver. The text/plain produces declaration misdescribes the intended HTML representation.\\\"],[\\\"Q50\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q50/contract/swagger.yml:1009-1016,1072-1081; Q50/impl/gateway/server.go:577-579\\\",\\\"⚠️ Organization-key operations share the singular org route family in the router. The plural member path in the contract is a documentation inconsistency.\\\"],[\\\"Q51\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q51/contract/rest/admin-v2/api/src/main/java/org/keycloak/representations/admin/v2/ClientRepresentation.java:24-43; Q51/impl/rest/admin-v2/rest/src/main/java/org/keycloak/admin/api/client/DefaultClientApi.java:75-89; Q51/impl/rest/admin-v2/api/src/main/java/org/keycloak/services/client/DefaultClientService.java:54-61; Q51/impl/rest/admin-v2/api/src/main/java/org/keycloak/models/mapper/MapStructClientModelMapper.java:20-33\\\",\\\"⚠️ PATCH updates the DTO then invokes toModel, whose renamed properties lack reverse mappings. Submitted name, homepage and redirect URL changes do not reach their model properties.\\\"],[\\\"Q52\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q52/contract/swagger.json:435-438,1505-1506; Q52/impl/src/main/java/org/traccar/api/resource/PositionResource.java:49-67; Q52/impl/src/main/java/org/traccar/model/Position.java:289-296; Q52/impl/src/main/java/org/traccar/model/Network.java:23-40\\\",\\\"⚠️ Position exposes a structured Network bean with named properties. The response schema's string type fails to describe that model.\\\"],[\\\"Q53\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",2,\\\"Q53/contract/src/main/config/openapi/v2/openapi-user.yaml:675-681,1558-1563; Q53/impl/src/main/java/org/codelibs/fess/api/v2/handlers/ChatStreamHandler.java:227-233; Q53/impl/src/main/java/org/codelibs/fess/api/v2/handlers/ChatRequestBody.java:145-149; Q53/impl/src/main/java/org/codelibs/fess/helper/ChatApiHelper.java:238-250\\\",\\\"⚠️ Streaming chat deliberately enforces a configurable message-length limit, defaulting to 4000. The shared message schema omits this constraint.\\\"],[\\\"Q54\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",2,\\\"Q54/contract/docs/api.swagger.json:446,506-540,1032-1039; Q54/contract/engine/ladon/handler.go:266-285; Q54/impl/engine/ladon/handler.go:285,380-393\\\",\\\"⚠️ The concrete route and handler both remove one path-identified member. The collection-path annotation and plural body schema appear stale; the summary also describes removing a single member.\\\"],[\\\"Q55\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",2,\\\"Q55/contract/src/main/config/openapi/openapi-user.yaml:593-622; Q55/impl/src/main/java/org/codelibs/fess/api/json/SearchApiManager.java:328-343,800-830\\\",\\\"⚠️ The suggestion writer deliberately uses the API's query_time, record_count and page_size naming and emits item tags as labels. The contract describes a different naming scheme.\\\"],[\\\"Q56\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q56/contract/.schema/api.swagger.json:449-451,493-501; Q56/impl/engine/ladon/handler.go:292-304; Q56/impl/storage/handler.go:85-95,110-126\\\",\\\"⚠️ The role filter initializes a nil result slice and only appends matches. Empty results therefore reach the JSON writer as null instead of the documented array.\\\"],[\\\"Q57\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q57/contract/swagger.json:894-896,1505-1506; Q57/impl/src/main/java/org/traccar/api/resource/ReportResource.java:96-102; Q57/impl/src/main/java/org/traccar/model/Position.java:289-296; Q57/impl/src/main/java/org/traccar/model/Network.java:23-40\\\",\\\"⚠️ Route reports return Position beans whose network property is a structured Network object. The contract incorrectly types this property as a string.\\\"],[\\\"Q58\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q58/contract/internal/api/swagger.json:72-93; Q58/impl/internal/api/links.go:233-258; Q58/impl/internal/entity/album.go:1040-1043; Q58/impl/internal/entity/link.go:22,212-218\\\",\\\"⚠️ The endpoint explicitly returns all album share links, and Links is a slice. The single-Link response annotation incorrectly models this collection.\\\"],[\\\"Q59\\\",\\\"IMPL\\\",3,\\\"Q59/contract/registry/app/api/openapi/api.yaml:749-774; Q59/impl/registry/app/api/controller/metadata/get_artifact_detail.go:98-105; Q59/impl/registry/app/store/database/image.go:166-188; Q59/impl/store/database/util.go:55-60\\\",\\\"⚠️ An absent image becomes ErrResourceNotFound in persistence, but the details handler converts it to a typed 500 response. This loses the documented 404 distinction.\\\"],[\\\"Q60\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q60/contract/docs/api.swagger.json:230-238; Q60/impl/engine/ladon/handler.go:29-46,439-448,466-472\\\",\\\"⚠️ Glob has explicit enabled-flavor and storage support, and deletion accepts any enabled flavor. The contract's two-flavor description is incomplete.\\\"],[\\\"Q61\\\",\\\"SPEC\\\",3,\\\"Q61/contract/nifi-nar-bundles/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-web/nifi-web-api/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/FlowFileQueueResource.java:418-432; Q61/impl/nifi-nar-bundles/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-web/nifi-web-api/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/FlowFileQueueResource.java:473-486; Q61/impl/nifi-nar-bundles/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-client-dto/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/entity/ListingRequestEntity.java:27-41\\\",\\\"⚠️ Deleting a listing request returns its listing status and envelope, matching the operation's purpose. DropRequestEntity is a copied annotation for a different queue operation.\\\"]]\")
report=json.loads(\"\\\"**L6 — অন্ধ contract review**\\\\n\\\\n**পদ্ধতি।** "'`items.csv`-এর ক্রমে Q01–Q61 স্বাধীনভাবে পর্যালোচনা করেছি। প্রথম shell command ছিল `cat TASK_M1.md`; এরপর অনুমোদিত `../../../09_collab/PROTOCOL.md` পড়েছি। প্রতিটি proposition-কে যাচাইয়ের প্রশ্ন হিসেবে ধরে সেই item-এর contract, route, handler, mapper ও প্রাসঙ্গিক persistence/helper code অনুসরণ করেছি। অন্য item-এর ফাইলের সঙ্গে তুলনা করে সিদ্ধান্ত নিইনি। নির্দেশনা: `TASK_M1.md:6–28`।'"\\\\n\\\\nকোন artifact intended behaviour থেকে বিচ্যুত, তা নির্ধারণে operation-এর উদ্দেশ্য, একই item-এর ব্যাখ্যামূলক মন্তব্য, control flow ও schema-র অভ্যন্তরীণ সামঞ্জস্য বিবেচনা করেছি। সিদ্ধান্তের inferential অংশ rationale-এ ⚠️ দিয়ে চিহ্নিত। প্রত্যেক CSV row-তে নিজ item-এর evidence locator আছে; confidence 1–3 এবং rationale সর্বোচ্চ 40 শব্দ। উৎস: "'`TASK_M1.md:24–44`; ফল: `labels_L6.csv:2–62`।'"\\\\n\\\\n**Label distribution।** মোট 61টি item-এর প্রতিটির জন্য একটি L1 label দেওয়া হয়েছে; CSV header ছাড়া 61টি row আছে। উৎস: "'`items.csv:2–62`, `labels_L6.csv:2–62`।'"\\\\n\\\\n| L1 | সংখ্যা |\\\\n| --- | ---: |\\\\n| SPEC | 36 |\\\\n| IMPL | 25 |\\\\n| TEST | 0 |\\\\n| ENV | 0 |\\\\n| UNDECIDABLE | 0 |\\\\n| মোট | 61 |\\\\n\\\\nConfidence 3 হয়েছে 51টি এবং confidence 2 হয়েছে 10টি; confidence 1 নেই। সংখ্যাগুলি সম্পূর্ণ CSV থেকে গণনা করা। উৎস: "'`labels_L6.csv:2–62`।'"\\\\n\\\\n**কঠিন সিদ্ধান্ত।**\\\\n\\\\n- Q07: ⚠️ configurable message limit-কে ইচ্ছাকৃত input constraint ধরে SPEC, confidence 2 দিয়েছি; সীমাটি schema-তে নেই। প্রমাণ: "'`Q07/contract/src/main/config/openapi/v2/openapi-user.yaml:1558–1563`; `Q07/impl/src/main/java/org/codelibs/fess/helper/ChatApiHelper.java:238–250`।'"\\\\n- Q12: ⚠️ অজানা flag-এর জন্য শূন্য flagID ও diagnostic-সহ blank result-কে deliberate fallback ধরে SPEC, confidence 2 দিয়েছি। Runtime বা history না থাকায় ইতিবাচক ID বজায় রাখাই আসল intent ছিল কি না নিশ্চিত নয়। প্রমাণ: "'`Q12/impl/pkg/handler/eval.go:84–119`; `Q12/contract/docs/api_docs/bundle.yaml:1106–1121`।'"\\\\n- Q15: ⚠️ implementation-এর UI ও evaluation catalog সম্পর্কে স্পষ্ট মন্তব্যের ভিত্তিতে enabled namespace-গুলিই effective catalog ধরে SPEC, confidence 2 দিয়েছি। বিকল্প ব্যাখ্যায় সংরক্ষিত disabled configuration-ও দেখানো কাম্য হতে পারে। প্রমাণ: "'`Q15/impl/pkg/handler/enricher.go:108–123,189–206`; `Q15/contract/docs/api_docs/bundle.yaml:1349–1357`।'"\\\\n- Q27: ⚠️ endpoint prose ও parameter annotation দুটিতেই namespace আবশ্যিক, কিন্তু handler ও DAO omission মেনে নেয়; তাই IMPL, confidence 2। Generic DAO-র optional filter একা endpoint-এর intent প্রমাণ করে না। প্রমাণ: "'`Q27/impl/internal/relationtuple/read_server.go:50–57,97–117`; `Q27/impl/internal/persistence/sql/relationtuples.go:230–235`।'"\\\\n- Q45: ⚠️ প্রদত্ত authorization callback-এ inherited-context read check পাইনি; IMPL, confidence 2। অনুপস্থিত service implementation-এর ভিতরে অতিরিক্ত authorization আছে কি না এখানে যাচাই করা যায়নি। প্রমাণ: "'`Q45/impl/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-web/nifi-web-api/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/ParameterContextResource.java:177–187,726–745`; contract requirement একই item-এর `contract/nifi-framework-bundle/nifi-framework/nifi-web/nifi-web-api/src/main/java/org/apache/nifi/web/api/ParameterContextResource.java:663–669`।'"\\\\n- Q54: ⚠️ concrete route ও handler উভয়ই path-এর এক member ব্যবহার করে; তাই collection path ও plural body-কে stale documentation ধরে SPEC, confidence 2। History ছাড়া উল্টো ব্যাখ্যা পুরোপুরি বাদ দেওয়া যায় না। প্রমাণ: "'`Q54/impl/engine/ladon/handler.go:285,380–393`; `Q54/contract/docs/api.swagger.json:506–540,1032–1039`।'"\\\\n\\\\nঅন্য confidence-2 সিদ্ধান্তগুলির নিজস্ব প্রমাণ ও সংক্ষিপ্ত যুক্তি সংশ্লিষ্ট CSV row-তে রয়েছে: Q23, Q32, Q53 ও Q55। উৎস: "'`labels_L6.csv:24,33,54,56`।'"\\\\n\\\\n**সীমাবদ্ধতা।** প্যাকেজে runtime exchange ও VCS history নেই; তাই এগুলি static attribution, পরীক্ষায় পুনরুৎপাদিত ফল নয়। Network, Docker, Java, Maven, compilation অথবা item source execution করিনি। কেবল নিজের standard-library Python দিয়ে data পড়া, source excerpt redaction, output লেখা ও structural validation করেছি; repository module import করিনি। প্যাকেজের সীমা ও execution বিধি: "'`TASK_M1.md:10,20–22,40–44`।'"\\\\n\\\\nGenerated mapper implementation, framework serializer এবং কিছু service dependency সরবরাহ করা হয়নি। ⚠️ ওই অংশের ফল দৃশ্যমান declaration ও call flow থেকে অনুমিত; যেমন Q06-এর reverse mapping এবং Q38-এর nil slice serialization। প্রমাণ: "'`Q06/impl/rest/admin-v2/api/src/main/java/org/keycloak/models/mapper/MapStructClientModelMapper.java:18–33`; `Q38/impl/storage/handler.go:96–104,125–126`। Intent নির্ধারণের জন্য পুরোনো সংস্করণ, বাইরের documentation বা অন্য labeller-এর সিদ্ধান্ত ব্যবহার করিনি।'"\\\\n\\\\n**সীমানা ও privacy ঘটনা।** অননুমোদিত boundary access ঘটেনি। এই directory-র বাইরের একমাত্র পড়া ফাইল ছিল অনুমোদিত "'`../../../09_collab/PROTOCOL.md`। Board, coordinator task, codebook, অন্য labeller-এর output বা অন্য project copy খোলা বা search করা হয়নি; নতুন ফাইল কেবল `labels_L6.csv` এবং `report_L6.md`। অনুমোদিত সীমানা: `TASK_M1.md:3,15–23,41–44`।'"\\\\n\\\\nতবে source excerpt ছাপার সময় redaction filter দুটি credential-looking example বাদ দিতে পারেনি: "'`Q20/contract/api/openapi.yml:2093`-এর access-token example এবং `Q44/contract/swagger.yml:1064–1065`-এর OAuth-code example। মানগুলি এই report বা labels-এ পুনরায় দিইনি। এগুলি বাস্তব credential কি না যাচাই করিনি। প্রথম ঘটনার পরে token-prefix শনাক্তকরণ বাড়িয়েছি, কিন্তু দ্বিতীয় example-ও filter এড়িয়েছে; তাই privacy বিধির পূর্ণ অনুসরণ হয়েছে দাবি করছি না। প্রযোজ্য বিধি: `TASK_M1.md:20`।'"\\\\n\\\"\")
header=['item_id','L1','confidence','evidence_locators','rationale']
with open('items.csv', newline='') as f:
    expected=[r['item_id'] for r in csv.DictReader(f)]
assert [r[0] for r in rows] == expected
assert len(rows)==61 and len(set(r[0] for r in rows))==61
for item,label,confidence,locators,rationale in rows:
    assert label in {'SPEC','IMPL','TEST','ENV','UNDECIDABLE'}
    assert confidence in {1,2,3}
    assert len(rationale.split())<=40, (item,len(rationale.split()))
    for locator in locators.split('; '):
        path, refs=locator.split(':',1)
        p=Path(path)
        assert path.startswith(item+'/contract/') or path.startswith(item+'/impl/'), (item,path)
        assert p.is_file(), path
        count=len(p.read_text(errors='replace').splitlines())
        for ref in refs.split(','):
            bounds=[int(x) for x in ref.split('-')]
            assert len(bounds) in {1,2} and 1<=bounds[0]<=bounds[-1]<=count, locator
assert 'L2' not in header
with open('labels_L6.csv','w',newline='') as f:
    writer=csv.writer(f)
    writer.writerow(header)
    writer.writerows(rows)
Path('report_L6.md').write_text(report)
with open('labels_L6.csv',newline='') as f:
    reader=csv.DictReader(f)
    assert reader.fieldnames==header
    reread=list(reader)
assert len(reread)==61 and [r['item_id'] for r in reread]==expected
assert all(len(r['rationale'].split())<=40 for r in reread)
print(json.dumps({'rows':len(reread),'labels':dict(Counter(r['L1'] for r in reread)),'confidence':dict(Counter(r['confidence'] for r in reread)),'maximum_rationale_words':max(len(r['rationale'].split()) for r in reread),'evidence_locators':'all item-local paths and line references validated','outputs':['labels_L6.csv','report_L6.md']},ensure_ascii=False))

